{"id":2833,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IL4958oRMfL4CPLC7UPL4NDnR-aL7nQfL8M7MRNaU4UbL4L0gihFp2hmCIa0LShfnkyYMSh7UmLsU4TfolW2M4QVL4-aL8liLRQVLz9DnmrFL8l4UmNbMmAFLl-sLl-Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLz-sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11127&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1AD25DB37C9A9BF76E3203E506E186F5/3E3B9968/1B71B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IL4958oRMfL4CPLC7UPL4NDnR-aL7nQfL8M7MRNaU4UbL4L0gihFp2hmCIa0LShfnkyYMSh7UmLsU4TfolW2M4QVL4-aL8liLRQVLz9DnmrFL8l4UmNbMmAFLl-sLl-Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLz-sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11127&e=.jpg\"></p><p>为倾听学生心声、解决实际难题，搭建学院与学生高效沟通桥梁，2026年4月3日，人文社会科学学院“书记连心话人文”主题座谈会在学院615会议室圆满举行。学院党委书记孙俊伟、党委副书记王晓东、副院长杜鹃、团委书记李娜出席会议，与各年级学生代表面对面交流，现场回应诉求，共商学院育人服务提升举措。&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IUlr52nN7iMm7inCRQfnmCZLmA2nzUQbUz9bUl74nN7sLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVM1yaLYy4nNnRMzGDL4M7LmWkLRGDMRLsM7nVLlLanRTFLzNPMNU8M7VFLlVfL8UJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLz-sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11127&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DE6033FDC50633D22B0064374DE1C0D9/1916D44A/1AA3D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IUlr52nN7iMm7inCRQfnmCZLmA2nzUQbUz9bUl74nN7sLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVM1yaLYy4nNnRMzGDL4M7LmWkLRGDMRLsM7nVLlLanRTFLzNPMNU8M7VFLlVfL8UJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLz-sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11127&e=.jpg\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IU4C5sMlUsMNV7LC4vsnR7ZM4-DoRWQ2oz-PozUYozvsM7-0gihFp2hmCIa0UShVLShVLYhVUN-4LRMRozCPUNWfMlrRU4CZUzGZU8MVL8QFMNQVLmG8UNnFLlr2MN7Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLz-sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11127&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AE1E3EBB303C961BBA5ECC68A08CCE3F/6FE204BD/1EF6A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IU4C5sMlUsMNV7LC4vsnR7ZM4-DoRWQ2oz-PozUYozvsM7-0gihFp2hmCIa0UShVLShVLYhVUN-4LRMRozCPUNWfMlrRU4CZUzGZU8MVL8QFMNQVLmG8UNnFLlr2MN7Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLz-sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11127&e=.jpg\"></p><p>座谈会氛围轻松热烈，学生代表结合自身学习生活实际踊跃发言，围绕学习安排、教学设备、宿舍设施、食堂用餐、文化活动五大方面，提出真实诉求与合理化建议。与会领导认真倾听记录，逐一针对性回应。&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=In7U5aMmUPn7QVnCm-bM7UsLzNbUNMQRMmUDMRG4LmvbM7U0gihFp2hmCIa0USyYnSh2U1y8o7nVozTRLR6kUzvaoRLbMzv4nR-inl7iUNnFnm9aMN-4UlQFLmnVL4vJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLz-sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11127&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A2EFB48DE99C07BA70839573D25EA5BD/F806B3AF/24E37\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=In7U5aMmUPn7QVnCm-bM7UsLzNbUNMQRMmUDMRG4LmvbM7U0gihFp2hmCIa0USyYnSh2U1y8o7nVozTRLR6kUzvaoRLbMzv4nR-inl7iUNnFnm9aMN-4UlQFLmnVL4vJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLz-sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11127&e=.jpg\"></p><section><p>座谈会最后，孙俊伟书记作总结讲话。他指出，此次座谈会是学院践行“以学生为中心”育人理念的具体实践，学生诉求就是工作导向。学院将以此次座谈为契机，建立常态化沟通机制，对学生提出的问题逐项梳理、狠抓落实、及时反馈，切实解决学生急难愁盼问题，全力打造优质学习生活环境，助力学子成长成才。</p><p>此次座谈会拉近了师生距离，让学生切实感受到学院的关怀与重视。未来，人文社会科学学院将持续聚焦学生需求，抓实问题整改，提升管理服务水平，以暖心服务护航学生全面发展，推动学院育人工作提质增效。</p></section><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://shss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IL4958oRMfL4CPLC7UPL4NDnR-aL7nQfL8M7MRNaU4UbL4L0gihFp2hmCIa0LShfnkyYMSh7UmLsU4TfolW2M4QVL4-aL8liLRQVLz9DnmrFL8l4UmNbMmAFLl-sLl-Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLz-sgtA8pUqcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11127&e=.jpg"}